This repository contains no Minecraft code, assets or data. It does not ship, patch
or redistribute the Minecraft jar.

The demo mod is written against Minecraft's public API and compiled against a
Minecraft jar resolved by Fabric Loom at build time, the same way every Fabric mod
is built. Method and field names were read from the compiled jar's public
signatures (javap) and from Fabric's public documentation; no decompiled Minecraft
source is included or redistributed.

Fabric's documentation and example mod informed the patterns used here (item and
block registration, game tests, client screenshots). Those sources are licensed
separately (Fabric docs: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; fabric-example-mod: CC0-1.0). The code in
this repository is our own implementation.

